      "title": "📐 Aspect Ratio Simplifier",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### 📐 Aspect Ratio Simplifier\n\n| Widget | What it does |\n|--------|----------------|\n| **max_resolution** | Caps the longer side. `0` = no limit. |\n| **resolution_source** | **image/mask** = use input size · **custom / preset** = use aspect ratio or custom W/H. |\n| **aspect_ratio** | social media style preset (or `custom`). |\n| **custom_width / custom_height** | Target size when preset is `custom`. |\n| **swap_dimensions** | Swaps width and height of the chosen size. |\n| **upscale_method** | Resample filter (nearest-exact, lanczos, etc.). |\n| **proportion** | How to fit: crop, stretch, resize, pad, total_pixels. |\n| **crop_location** | Anchor for crop/pad (center, top, bottom, left, right). |\n| **pad_color** | RGB fill when proportion is pad. |\n| **divisible_by** | Rounds output size to a multiple (e.g. 8). |\n| **batch_size** | Batch count for the empty latent output. |\n\n**Inputs:** `image` and/or `mask` (image preferred for size; mask-only works).  \n**Outputs:** `image`, `mask`, `width`, `height`, `latent`, `batch`."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
